{
  "slug": "sweet-potato-waffles",
  "title": "Sweet Potato Waffles",
  "blurb": "Soft waffles with a natural sweetness from sweet potato purée, warmly spiced with nutmeg and a touch of brown sugar.",
  "steps": [
    "Heat your waffle iron according to the manufacturer's instructions.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together the flour, baking powder, nutmeg and salt.",
    "In another bowl, whisk the sweet potato purée with the milk, eggs, melted butter and brown sugar until smooth.",
    "Pour the wet ingredients into the dry and stir gently until just combined, leaving a few small lumps.",
    "Ladle the batter onto the hot waffle iron, close the lid and cook until golden and crisp, about 5 minutes per batch.",
    "Serve the waffles warm."
